{"info": {"author": "OpenLineage", "author_email": null, "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": ["Development Status :: 5 - Production/Stable", "Intended Audience :: Developers", "License :: OSI Approved :: Apache Software License", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.10", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.11", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.12", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.13", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.14"], "description": "# OpenLineage Integration Common\n\nCommon modules for OpenLineage integrations.\n\nFor setting up a development environment, see the [Python development setup guide](https://openlineage.io/docs/client/python/development/setup).\n\n## SQL parser defaults\n\nIntegrations can pass their active database and schema to qualify unqualified\ntables and input column origins:\n\n```python\nfrom openlineage.common.sql import parse\n\nmetadata = parse(\n    \"INSERT INTO target SELECT id FROM source\",\n    dialect=\"postgres\",\n    default_schema=\"public\",\n    default_database=\"mydb\",\n)\n```\n\nExplicit SQL qualifiers and dialect-specific `USE` statements take precedence\nover the supplied defaults. Defaults are scoped to each parse call; callers must\nprovide their current connection context explicitly.\n\n`default_database` is the third (database) level of a `database.schema.table`\nname. For dialects with only one namespace level above the table, such as MySQL,\nHive, or Spark without a catalog, the parser reads a two-part name `x.t` as\nschema `x`. For these dialects, pass the connection's database or namespace as\n`default_schema`, not `default_database`:\n\n```python\n# MySQL connection to database \"mydb\"\nparse(\"INSERT INTO mydb.t SELECT * FROM t\", dialect=\"mysql\", default_schema=\"mydb\")\n# input and output are both mydb.t\n```\n\nPassing `default_database=\"mydb\"` instead would name the input `mydb.t` and the\noutput `mydb.mydb.t`.\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": null, "home_page": null, "keywords": "openlineage", "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_expression": null, "license_files": null, "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "openlineage-integration-common", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/openlineage-integration-common/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/openlineage-integration-common/", "project_urls": {"Homepage": "https://openlineage.io/", "Source": "https://github.com/OpenLineage/OpenLineage/tree/main/integration/common"}, "provides_extra": ["bigquery", "dbt", "dev", "dev-no-parser", "great-expectations", "redshift", "tests"], "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/openlineage-integration-common/1.55.0/", "requires_dist": ["attrs>=19.3.0", "jinja2>=2.11.3", "openlineage-python", "openlineage-sql>=1.55.0", "pyyaml>=5.3.1", "google-api-core>=1.26.3; extra == \"bigquery\"", "google-auth>=1.30.0; extra == \"bigquery\"", "google-cloud-bigquery<4.0.0,>=3; extra == \"bigquery\"", "google-cloud-core>=1.6.0; extra == \"bigquery\"", "google-crc32c>=1.1.2; extra == \"bigquery\"", "google-api-core>=1.26.3; extra == \"dev\"", "google-auth>=1.30.0; extra == \"dev\"", "google-cloud-bigquery<4.0.0,>=3; extra == \"dev\"", "google-cloud-core>=1.6.0; extra == \"dev\"", "google-crc32c>=1.1.2; extra == \"dev\"", "great-expectations>=1.0.0; extra == \"dev\"", "sqlalchemy<2.0.0,>=1.3.24; extra == \"dev\"", "boto3>=1.15.0; extra == \"dev\"", "pytest; extra == \"dev\"", "pytest-cov; extra == \"dev\"", "pytest-mock; extra == \"dev\"", "mock; extra == \"dev\"", "pandas; extra == \"dev\"", "jinja2; extra == \"dev\"", "python-dateutil; extra == \"dev\"", "mypy>=0.960; extra == \"dev\"", "types-python-dateutil; extra == \"dev\"", "types-pyyaml; extra == \"dev\"", "ruff; extra == \"dev\"", "google-api-core>=1.26.3; extra == \"dev-no-parser\"", "google-auth>=1.30.0; e